			"notes": "Find any build in your world automatically — like X-ray for structures.\n\nLoad a Litematica .litematic (or .nbt) schematic, enable the mod, and HISTB? highlights every matching structure around you in real time — rotated and mirrored copies included.\n\n**Requires:** Fabric API + MaLiLib (Minecraft 26.1.2, Fabric).\n\n**Quick start:** drop the jar in your mods folder → Mod Menu → HISTB? → Schematics tab (load a file) → General tab (turn ON). All keybinds are unbound by default; everything is reachable from Mod Menu.\n\nSee the README for full setup + troubleshooting."
		}
